      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't quite follow the part about the goblins? i'm just looking for technical advice on the sublimation process. could you stick to the pressure and temperature variables? i need to know if 4 bar is standard for high-density dark inks or if i should be looking at the dwell time more closely.",
